{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-tokenslash#card-zh","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-tokenslash","commit":"335071e077d56209a4385450cd5597197451099f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"TokenSlash 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的上下文优化插件。它通过 Cordis 插件入口接入工具、提示词、agent 生命周期和设置面板，并可向 Web 服务挂载配置桥接路由。主要功能包括按任务裁剪工具和提示词、按任务为子代理选择模型层级、压缩过长工具输出、管理旧观察内容，以及用 peek 检查或恢复被裁剪的工具；还提供索引、批处理、诊断和 triage 工具。适合希望减少上下文开销并保留按需恢复能力的 DSH 用户。需要配置一个 Jev 结构化决策提供方；可使用远程服务或本地兼容端点。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31","lib/index.js:152","lib/index.js:391","lib/hooks/prompt-prune.js:518","lib/hooks/routing.js:214","lib/hooks/compact.js:60","lib/hooks/observation-mask.js:125"]}
{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-tokenslash#card-en","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-tokenslash","commit":"335071e077d56209a4385450cd5597197451099f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"TokenSlash optimizes context in the DSH web client through task-aware tool and prompt pruning, subagent model routing, output compaction, and recoverable tool access. It also adds file indexing, tool batching, diagnostics, and structured triage. Configure a Jev decision provider, remote or local.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31","lib/index.js:152","lib/index.js:391","lib/hooks/prompt-prune.js:518","lib/hooks/routing.js:214","lib/hooks/compact.js:60","lib/hooks/observation-mask.js:125"]}
